{"speciesId":616,"names":{"fr":"Escargaume","es":"Shelmet","en":"Shelmet","ja":"チョボマキ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Quand on l’attaque, il referme sa visière pour se défendre, et projette un poison visqueux."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When attacked, it defends itself by closing the lid of its shell. It can spit a sticky, poisonous liquid."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il évolue quand il baigne dans une énergie électrique avec un Carabing. La cause en est inconnue."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It evolves when bathed in an electric-like energy along with Karrablast. The reason is still unknown."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When it and Karrablast are together, and both receive electrical stimulation, they both evolve."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When it and Karrablast are together, and both receive electrical stimulation, they both evolve."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"S’il est à proximité d’un Carabing et que les deux reçoivent une décharge électrique, ils évoluent en même temps."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Si está junto a Karrablast, y ambos reciben una descarga eléctrica, evolucionan los dos a la vez."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"When it and Karrablast are together, and both receive electrical stimulation, they both evolve."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"カブルモと 一緒に いるときに 電気的な 刺激を 受けると お互いの 体が 進化する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il évolue quand il baigne dans une énergie électrique avec un Carabing. La cause en est inconnue."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Evoluciona si entra en contacto con energía eléctrica junto a Karrablast. Aún no se ha esclarecido el porqué."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It evolves when bathed in an electric-like energy along with Karrablast. The reason is still unknown."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"カブルモと ともに 電気的な エネルギーを 浴びると 進化する。 理由は 解明されていない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"S’il est à proximité d’un Carabing et que les deux reçoivent une décharge électrique, ils évoluent en même temps."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Si está junto a Karrablast, y ambos reciben una descarga eléctrica, evolucionan los dos a la vez."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"When it and Karrablast are together, and both receive electrical stimulation, they both evolve."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"カブルモと 一緒に いるときに 電気的な 刺激を 受けると お互いの 体が 進化する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il évolue quand il baigne dans une énergie électrique avec un Carabing. La cause en est inconnue."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Evoluciona si entra en contacto con energía eléctrica junto a Karrablast. Aún no se ha esclarecido el porqué."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It evolves when bathed in an electric-like energy along with Karrablast. The reason is still unknown."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"カブルモと ともに 電気的な エネルギーを 浴びると 進化する。 理由は 解明されていない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il se recroqueville dans sa carapace en fermant la visière lorsque des ennemis approchent. Carabing peut néanmoins en forcer l’entrée."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cierra a cal y canto la visera de su caparazón al ser atacado. Solo los Karrablast pueden abrirla."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"When attacked, it tightly shuts the lid of its shell. This reaction fails to protect it from Karrablast, however, because they can still get into the shell."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"敵に 襲われると 殻の 蓋を がっちり 閉めて 身を 守る。 ただし カブルモには 開けられる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il a l’étrange faculté de réagir à l’énergie électrique. On ne sait trop pourquoi, mais quand il se trouve aux côtés de Carabing, il évolue."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Debido a su peculiar constitución, reacciona ante la energía eléctrica. Por alguna misteriosa razón, evoluciona en presencia de Karrablast."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It has a strange physiology that responds to electricity. When together with Karrablast, Shelmet evolves for some reason."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"電気 エネルギーに 反応する 不思議な 体質。 カブルモと ともに いると なぜか 進化する。"}],"varieties":[{"id":616,"moves":[{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[11,"level-up",40],[14,"level-up",40],[15,"level-up",40],[16,"level-up",40],[17,"level-up",40],[18,"level-up",40],[20,"level-up",36],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0]]},{"name":"acid","learns":[[11,"level-up",4],[14,"level-up",4],[15,"level-up",4],[16,"level-up",4],[17,"level-up",4],[18,"level-up",4],[20,"level-up",4]]},{"name":"absorb","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-drain","learns":[[11,"level-up",20],[14,"level-up",20],[15,"level-up",20],[16,"level-up",20],[17,"level-up",20],[18,"level-up",20],[20,"level-up",12]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"recover","learns":[[11,"level-up",49],[14,"level-up",49],[15,"level-up",49],[16,"level-up",49],[17,"level-up",49],[18,"level-up",49],[20,"level-up",40]]},{"name":"bide","learns":[[11,"level-up",8],[14,"level-up",8],[15,"level-up",8],[16,"level-up",8],[17,"level-up",8],[18,"level-up",8]]},{"name":"leech-life","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"acid-armor","learns":[[11,"level-up",32],[14,"level-up",32],[15,"level-up",32],[16,"level-up",32],[17,"level-up",32],[18,"level-up",32],[20,"lev